The Author claims no ownership of that content, and this license grants no
rights to it and places no restrictions on it beyond those its owners set.
You must follow its owners' terms yourself. Sections 1 and 2 apply to the
Mod's own code and original assets, and to builds of the Mod as a whole.


5. IF THE MOD IS ABANDONED

If two years pass in which the Author publishes no Official Release and no
commit is added to the repository named above, the Mod's own code and
original assets also become available under the GNU General Public
License, version 3 (GPL-3.0). From then on, anyone may use the latest
version of the Mod at that time, and any earlier version, under either this
license or GPL-3.0. This cannot be withdrawn later, even if work on the Mod
resumes. Versions published after that are under this license only, unless
the Author says otherwise. Third-party content stays outside both licenses,
as section 4 describes.


6. TERMINATION

Your rights under this license end automatically if you break it. They come
back if you stop breaking it within 30 days of being told about it by the
Author. This applies only the first time you break this license. After that,
your rights come back only with the Author's written permission.


